# TextInputDialog

# dialog (vertical fill) — the dialog container scales to fit
# the inner dialog (vertical auto), which:
#   1. centers itself inside the screen (BaseDialog centres ModalScreen)
#   2. the inner #dialog is a Vertical with max-width 60
#   3. title / hint / input / buttons stack vertically

# The overall screen is ModalScreen → BaseDialog → Vertical#dialog

Vertical#dialog {
    align: center center;
    height: auto;
    margin: 1 2;
    min-width: 40;
    max-width: 60;
}

Label#title {
    text-style: bold;
    padding: 1 2;
}

Label.hint {
    padding: 0 2;
}

Input#text-input {
    margin: 1 2;
    min-width: 30;
}

Horizontal#buttons {
    height: auto;
    align: center center;
    padding: 0 1;
}

Horizontal#buttons > ToolbarButton {
    margin: 0 1;
    min-width: 12;
}